  "description": "<p data-end=\"32\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"30\" data-start=\"0\">Blackstar Creatine Gummies</strong></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"384\" data-start=\"34\">&bull; <strong data-end=\"59\" data-start=\"36\">Brand Introduction:</strong><br data-end=\"62\" data-start=\"59\">Blackstar is a cutting-edge sports nutrition brand dedicated to delivering high-quality, effective, and convenient supplements for athletes, fitness enthusiasts, and anyone looking to enhance their performance. We focus on innovative formulations that combine science-backed ingredients with great taste and convenience.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"782\" data-start=\"386\">&bull; <strong data-end=\"412\" data-start=\"388\">Product Description:</strong><br data-end=\"415\" data-start=\"412\">Blackstar Creatine Gummies provide a powerful and delicious way to fuel your muscles with premium creatine monohydrate. Designed for easy consumption without the need for water or mixing, these gummies support strength, endurance, and muscle recovery. Each serving delivers an optimal dose of creatine to enhance performance and help you achieve your fitness goals.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"819\" data-start=\"784\">&bull; <strong data-end=\"817\" data-start=\"786\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1109\" data-start=\"820\">\r\n<li data-end=\"888\" data-start=\"820\">Convenient and tasty alternative to traditional creatine powders</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"951\" data-start=\"889\">Fast-absorbing formula for improved strength and endurance</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1014\" data-start=\"952\">No bloating or gritty texture, making it easy on digestion</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1054\" data-start=\"1015\">Ideal for on-the-go supplementation</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1109\" data-start=\"1055\">Available in delicious, naturally flavored options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1133\" data-start=\"1111\">&bull; <strong data-end=\"1131\" data-start=\"1113\">Payment Terms:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1381\" data-start=\"1134\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1213\" data-start=\"1134\">Flexible payment options available (dependent on order quantity and region)</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1262\" data-start=\"1214\">Bulk purchase discounts for wholesale buyers</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1323\" data-start=\"1263\">Secure online transactions with multiple payment methods</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1381\" data-start=\"1324\">Customizable payment plans for long-term partnerships</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1409\" data-start=\"1383\">&bull; <strong data-end=\"1407\" data-start=\"1385\">Other Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1729\" data-start=\"1410\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1483\" data-start=\"1410\">Manufactured in a GMP-certified facility to ensure quality and safety</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1551\" data-start=\"1484\">Free from artificial colors, fillers, and unnecessary additives</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1630\" data-start=\"1552\">Suitable for athletes, bodybuilders, and fitness enthusiasts of all levels</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1694\" data-start=\"1631\">Available in multiple flavors to suit different preferences</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1729\" data-start=\"1695\">Shelf-stable and easy to store</li>\r\n</ul>",
